; QRX 22.5.12 scenario: Directory Opus 5.104 (m68k, AmigaOS 3.x build) on Deadwood AROS
FailAt 100
Assign QRX: SYS:QRX >NIL:
Assign DOpus5: SYS:DOpus5
; open the Workbench screen first (the scenario runs before Startup-Sequence starts Wanderer)
Run <NIL: >NIL: WANDERER:Wanderer
Wait 20
Avail >QRXOUT:avail-before.txt
QRX:C/amigacheck SYS:DOpus5/DirectoryOpus >QRXOUT:amigacheck.txt
Echo "QRXTEST AMIGACHECK rc=$RC" >>QRXOUT:amigacheck.txt
QRX:C/amigarun ASYNC SYS:DOpus5/DirectoryOpus >QRXOUT:amigarun.txt
Echo "QRXTEST AMIGARUN rc=$RC" >>QRXOUT:amigarun.txt
Wait 90
Avail >QRXOUT:avail-running.txt
Status >QRXOUT:status.txt
Status FULL >QRXOUT:tasks.txt
QRX:C/QRXScreenGrab QRXOUT:screen.ppm >QRXOUT:grab.txt
; second look after another 3 emulated minutes (DOpus initialises slowly without JIT)
Wait 180
QRX:C/QRXScreenGrab QRXOUT:screen2.ppm >QRXOUT:grab2.txt
Status FULL >QRXOUT:tasks2.txt
Echo "done" >QRXOUT:DONE
